  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "City status Incomplete as of the 2026-10-21 update. Former Hick'ry Pit restaurant site.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001550"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City permit record PLN-2026-27: seven-story mixed-use building with one basement level, about 89 feet tall, about 583,400 gross sq ft, 324 units, about 6,000 sq ft of ground-floor commercial space and 577 parking spaces; status Incomplete as of the 2026-11-04 update.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001549"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 2024 preliminary plans (dated 08/01/2024) are titled Cannery Place / Cannery Mixed-Use, with E. Barbano Enterprises LLC as client and team BAR Architects & Interiors, Kier & Wright, The Guzzardo Partnership, Alter Engineers, Coffman Engineers, Watry Design, Charles M. Salter Associates and KPFF.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "San Jose Spotlight: the plan includes ground-floor retail, a fitness room, club rooms, pool and spa and a top-floor common deck; the city's 15% affordable housing requirement was cited as a feasibility obstacle.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001550"
      ]
    }
